{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">中國海警在黃岩島領海及周邊執法巡查，並依法依規處置非法侵權船隻。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">海警萬山艦執法員周海燕說：「組成單縱隊，航向090，準備執行。」</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.DRILL 1830.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026ovdfSoeF3z1788091475.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.CN.DRILL 1830.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">中國海警萬山艦、達濠艦和海鷗艦等多艘艦艇組成的編隊，近日在黃岩島海域巡航執法，並開展編隊航行，攔阻封控等多項演練，又管控驅離非法侵闖船隻。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.DRILL 1830_001.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026s0Tgga5CC21788091546.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.CN.DRILL 1830_001.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">海警萬山艦執法員邱燦輝說：「我們在黃岩島領海及周邊海域，實施常態化不間斷巡航，同時還加強了無人機空中的偵察，確保態勢第一時間感知，情況第一時間處置。」</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">今次演練，檢驗了海警快速反應應急處置的能力。下一步，中國海警將持續開展黃岩島附近海域執法巡查，強化海域管控，維護國家主權同海洋權益。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.DRILL 1830_002.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026sEEWmjcVma1788091525.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.CN.DRILL 1830_002.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">目前正值南海開漁季，海警又對附近海域漁船，進行漁業執法檢查和普及法律常識宣傳。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-30T12:18:51.635387+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":318,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}